857
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:12,880
In a few days,

858
00:42:14,199 --> 00:42:15,239
I'm leaving too.

859
00:42:16,039 --> 00:42:16,719
Take care.

860
00:42:17,360 --> 00:42:18,079
Take care.

861
00:42:33,040 --> 00:42:37,360
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

862
00:42:40,960 --> 00:42:45,320
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

863
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:52,080
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

864
00:42:52,320 --> 00:42:55,120
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

865
00:42:56,280 --> 00:43:00,920
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

866
00:43:04,120 --> 00:43:10,960
